The '''Path of Crondis''' in [[Tombs of Amascut]] leads to the [[Palm of Resourcefulness]] and  [[Zebak]], the guardian of [[Crondis]]. If another path has been entered, the crocodile head is removed to show that the other path is currently being attempted. After the path of Crondis is cleared, the fire disappears. 

